# ---- RimWorld mod packaging ----
# Only the runtime artefacts belong in the repo: Defs, Languages, Patches,
# Assemblies, Textures/Assets.zip and About.
# Everything below is local build/dev output.

# .NET build output (never ship these)
bin/
obj/
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json

# Waylith asset-pack bake metadata: regenerated by the game whenever Assets.zip
# changes, so the checked-in copies go stale (the fingerprint no longer matches the
# zip). Keep Assets.zip itself, but not these side-car files.
Assets.zip.fingerprint
Assets.zip.roles
Assets.zip.stamps

# Local scratch
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
*~

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
